{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"houfei-e-o049b","title":"明帝即位拜郭氏夫人郭立郭芝任官","accounts":[{"id":"houfei-e-o049b-account","label":"《后妃传》正文","text":"明帝即位拜郭氏夫人郭立郭芝任官","evidence":["houfei-e-o049b-q"]}],"participants":[{"person":"mingdi-p0054","role":"受位","evidence":["houfei-e-o049b-q"]},{"person":"houfei-p0073","role":"任骑都尉","evidence":["houfei-e-o049b-q"]},{"person":"shaodi-p0070","role":"任虎贲中郎将","evidence":["houfei-e-o049b-q"]}],"place":null,"time":{"year":226,"label":"明帝即位","precision":"year","basis":"逐条核对本篇纪年及所引释年；未换算公历日。","chronology":"houfei-y226","dating_review":{"reviewed":true,"anchor":"houfei-q-o014","basis":"明帝即位"},"evidence":["houfei-e-o049b-q","houfei-q-o014","mingdi-q-o001","mingdi-q-b-b7b4e1eced04c86a11c0"]},"ordering_evidence":"houfei-e-o049b-q","source_order":[5,236,"O049b"],"order":1461}],"persons":[{"id":"houfei-p0073","name":"郭立","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"mingdi-p0054","name":"郭皇后（曹叡后）","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"shaodi-p0070","name":"郭芝","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"houfei-e-o049b-q","section":"chapter-005","block":"b-f669d0efeea97feb8953","layer":"original","quote":"明元郭皇后，西平人也。世河右大族〖1〗。黄初中，本郡反叛，遂没入宫。明帝即位，甚见爱幸，拜为夫人；叔父立为骑都尉，从父芝为虎贲中郎将。","section_title":"后妃传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0015.xhtml","index":235,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":67},{"id":"houfei-q-o014","section":"chapter-005","block":"b-87bc74c5c9a764cda8ec","layer":"original","quote":"初，太后弟秉，以功封都乡侯。黄初七年，进封开阳侯，邑千二百户，为昭烈将军〖15〗。﹝二﹞秉薨，子兰嗣。少有才学，﹝三﹞为奉车都尉，游击将军〖16〗，加散骑常侍。兰薨，子晖嗣。﹝四﹞又分秉爵，封兰弟琳为列侯，官至步兵校尉。","section_title":"后妃传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0015.xhtml","index":46,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":110},{"id":"mingdi-q-b-b7b4e1eced04c86a11c0","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-b7b4e1eced04c86a11c0","layer":"modern","quote":"〖2〗七年：黄初七年（公元226）。","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":4,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-7290e2008f81d6cad349","start":0,"end":18},{"id":"mingdi-q-o001","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-fe69417d79b76e276a24","layer":"original","quote":"明皇帝讳叡，字元仲。文帝太子也。生而太祖爱之，常令在左右。﹝一﹞年十五，封武德侯。黄初二年为齐公。三年为平原王〖1〗。以其母诛，故未建为嗣。﹝二﹞七年夏五月〖2〗，帝病笃，乃立为皇太子。丁巳〖3〗，即皇帝位。大赦；尊皇太后曰太皇太后〖4〗，皇后曰皇太后〖5〗；诸臣封爵各有差。﹝三﹞〔六月〕，癸未〖6〗，追谥母甄夫人曰文昭皇后〖7〗。壬辰〖8〗，立皇弟蕤为阳平王〖9〗。","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":1,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":185}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
